From 1732f8c0a333514035134e3cfe0c921166eedc75 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: amber <amber@flourish.ch>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 18:59:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] Add Vesper help and internal settings surfaces

Expose the hidden settings behind seven version taps, replace the visible About content, and route help links to Vesper resources.

Adapted from settings and help work by Oscar Mira and other Molly contributors.
